From 1ea02d3a0d6310f1abf6c3915ba5bfb79c4c6899 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Pelenitsyn <a.pelenitsyn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:31:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Present the hashable of mhs at version 1.4.7.0

MicroCabal has the hashable bundled in the base of mhs at 1.0.0.0, "very
rudimentary", which makes no difference to it, as it does not check bounds.
But the Data.Hashable of mhs has the API of the 1.4 series
(Data.Hashable.Lifted, Hashable1 with an Eq1 superclass), and the packages
that depend on hashable require at least that: unordered-containers 1.4,
these 1.4.4. With 1.0.0.0, the solver built hashable-1.5.1.0 from Hackage for
them instead, which mhs cannot compile, so unordered-containers, async,
psqueues, vault and these failed on MicroHs's package list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0176vAefrw8jPKXdh9h1wKuj
---
 Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs | 9 +++++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs b/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs
index 0122de8c3..e2fe47f21 100644
--- a/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs
+++ b/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs
@@ -351,7 +351,12 @@ parseFields = go . lines
 --
 -- The versions are those that MicroCabal uses for the same purpose; in its
 -- words, "the version numbers are totally fake; they are from GHC". They say
--- which API the modules roughly implement.
+-- which API the modules roughly implement. The exception is hashable, which
+-- MicroCabal has at 1.0.0.0, "very rudimentary": the Data.Hashable of mhs has
+-- the API of the 1.4 series (Data.Hashable.Lifted, Hashable1 with an Eq1
+-- superclass), and the packages that depend on hashable require at least that
+-- (unordered-containers 1.4, these 1.4.4), which MicroCabal can ignore, as it
+-- does not check bounds, but Cabal cannot.
 baseCompatVersion :: Version
 baseCompatVersion = mkVersion [4, 19, 1, 0]
 
@@ -360,7 +365,7 @@ bundledPackages =
   [ ("bytestring", [0, 12, 1, 0], ["Data.ByteString"])
   , ("deepseq", [1, 4, 4, 0], ["Control.DeepSeq"])
   , ("directory", [1, 3, 8, 1], ["System.Directory"])
-  , ("hashable", [1, 0, 0, 0], ["Data.Hashable"])
+  , ("hashable", [1, 4, 7, 0], ["Data.Hashable"])
   , ("integer-logarithms", [1, 0, 4], ["Math.NumberTheory"])
   , ("process", [1, 6, 18, 0], ["System.Process"])
   , ("stm", [2, 5, 3, 0], ["Control.Concurrent.STM", "Control.Monad.STM"])
